###### AKS STORAGE ########
First we create a storage class defining the storage configurations which the AKS should create for ex - Azure Managed disk, Storage account etc and also tier such as premium ssd etc.
imp fields in storage class:- 
1 Reclaim policy :- retain or delete (what happens to disk when PVC is deleted)
2 Volume Binding mode :- Immediate / Waif dor first customer
3 allow Volume expansion :- true/false (expand disk on demand)
_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
Secondly we have Persistent volume claim where its defined how much storage does the pod needs . For ex- 100 GB etc
_______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
Lastly Persistent Volume is the real storage(Disk,azure storage class) which gets created once PVC is created.
In case of AKS  - its autmoattically created by Azure
